~ start
$> CurrScene.has_received_scissors = local_save.flags.has("scissors") 
if CurrScene.has_received_scissors == false:
	Reckless kid: I LOVE playing with scissors!!!
	This seems dangerous. Will you take away the scissors?
	- Be responsible 
		You took away the scissors.
		Defused kid: Aw man.
		$> CurrScene.has_received_scissors = true
		$> local_save.flags["scissors"] = true
		do add_item("res://items/scissors.tres")
	- Endanger child
		The recklessnes continues.
else:
	Kid: Cry not for it's over, rejoice for it happened.
=> END